WEBVTT

00:01:29.517 --> 00:01:31.251
Norman Jewison aliniambia,

00:01:31.275 --> 00:01:34.267
"Nadhani huhusiana na kujishughulisha na jambo moja. "

00:01:34.773 --> 00:01:35.838
Na kukazana!

00:01:36.235 --> 00:01:38.223
Daudi Gallo anasema, "Jisukume.

00:01:38.247 --> 00:01:40.889
Kimwili, kiakili,
unapaswa kujisukuma, kujisukuma, kujisukuma."

00:01:40.913 --> 00:01:43.524
Unahitaji kujisukuma kutoka katika aibu na mashaka.

00:01:43.548 --> 00:01:45.976
Goldie Hawn anasema,
"Siku zote nilikuwa na mashaka.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.096
Sikuwa na ujuzi wakutosha;
Sikukuwa na kipaji cha kutosha.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.663
Sikufikiri ningeweza kufanikiwa."

00:01:50.264 --> 00:01:52.303
Daima si rahisi kujisukuma,

00:01:52.327 --> 00:01:54.415
na ndiyo maana tuna mama.

00:01:54.439 --> 00:01:55.439
(Vicheko)

00:01:55.439 --> 00:01:57.000
(Makofi)

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.976
Frank Gehry aliniambia,

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.370
"Mama yangu alinisukuma."